Package: multiflexi-tui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, multiflexi-cli
Description: Turbo Vision TUI frontend for MultiFlexi CLI
 multiflexi-tui provides a terminal user interface for the Multiflexi platform,
 built with the Turbo Vision (tvision) library.
 .
 It shells out to multiflexi-cli for all connectivity and renders companies,
 applications, run templates, jobs, credentials, users, events and admin
 operations in a classic text-mode UI, including:
  * Status dashboard and entity list/detail/create/edit screens
  * Activation and credential wizards
  * Live job stdout/stderr streaming via polled job:get
 .
 This package provides a keyboard-driven way to operate MultiFlexi without
 leaving the terminal.
